OL,3,GNEWSANew online tool to help search
OL,4,Acounty's archives
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 900 years of Surrey's history
OL,7,Fis now easier to access, thanks to an
OL,8,Finnovative new online search tool.
OL,10,FThe archives at Surrey History Centre,
OL,11,Fin Woking, hold about six million of
OL,12,Fthe county's documents, manuscripts and
OL,13,Fparchment records, some dating back to
OL,14,Fthe Middle Ages.
OL,16,FBut how these are navigated has been
OL,17,Fbrought into the 21st century, with a
OL,18,Frecently introduced collections
OL,19,Fmanagement system which allows users at
OL,20,Fhome to locate items and order them up
OL,21,Ffrom the vaults prior to their visit.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
